WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.134
- (beep) me that's good.

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:01.967
- [Selorm] It is really good.

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:03.009
- Wow, holy (beep).

00:00:03.009 --> 00:00:05.426
(jazz music)

00:00:08.093 --> 00:00:08.926
- Hi how you doing?

00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:09.759
- [Ali] Hi!
- [Kuwilileni] Hey!

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.304
- My name's Simon, I have been drafted in

00:00:11.304 --> 00:00:12.563
to be your bartender for today.

00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:15.025
What is a favorite go-to for you?

00:00:15.025 --> 00:00:16.110
- Anything with, like, herbs.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.744
So like fresh ginger.

00:00:17.744 --> 00:00:19.944
- I love all of these things right here.

00:00:19.944 --> 00:00:20.777
(Simon laughs)

00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:22.165
- I do like rum.

00:00:22.165 --> 00:00:24.159
I do like tequila.

00:00:24.159 --> 00:00:25.166
And whiskey.

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:26.775
- I know you're having
a good day or a bad day.

00:00:26.775 --> 00:00:27.784
(both laugh)

00:00:27.784 --> 00:00:30.053
- I typically don't really
go for the sweet cocktail.

00:00:30.053 --> 00:00:31.802
- If you have tequila I'm sold.

00:00:31.802 --> 00:00:33.385
I will drink it.

00:00:33.385 --> 00:00:35.235
Maybe I will drink way too many.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.528
But tequila it is.

00:00:36.528 --> 00:00:37.986
- Gin and tonics.

00:00:37.986 --> 00:00:39.903
And I like tiki drinks.

00:00:41.732 --> 00:00:42.984
- What does mine say about me?

00:00:42.984 --> 00:00:44.591
- Party, fiery, dance on the table.

00:00:44.591 --> 00:00:46.148
- Okay, oh (laughs).

00:00:46.148 --> 00:00:46.981
- 19 years old.

00:00:46.981 --> 00:00:48.065
(Simon laughs)

00:00:48.065 --> 00:00:49.557
- My favorite thing about
really good cocktails

00:00:49.557 --> 00:00:52.043
are they almost remind
you of medicine in a way.

00:00:52.043 --> 00:00:52.876
- [Ali] Oh my God.

00:00:52.876 --> 00:00:53.709
- Like a good salve.

00:00:53.709 --> 00:00:54.542
- [Kuwilileni] Or like,
- [Ali] Yes.

00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:55.375
- [Kuwilileni] something
along those lines.

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:56.311
- I love those big ice cubes (laughs)

00:00:56.311 --> 00:00:57.423
- [Simon] I love these.

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:58.776
- Did you hand-cut these below?

00:00:58.776 --> 00:01:01.193
(jazz music)

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:08.637
Mine smells like springtime.

00:01:08.637 --> 00:01:11.454
- [Ali] This is what you drink
when you can afford a boat.

00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:12.301
- [Kuwilileni] Yes, I agree.

00:01:12.301 --> 00:01:13.923
- This smells like the Titanic.

00:01:13.923 --> 00:01:15.027
(laughs)

00:01:15.027 --> 00:01:17.010
- The classy part.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:21.136
- [Selorm] Oh it looks
so nice, that color.

00:01:21.136 --> 00:01:21.969
Ta-da.

00:01:21.969 --> 00:01:22.802
(Simon laughs)

00:01:22.802 --> 00:01:24.059
- You just gonna dunk your head in that

00:01:24.059 --> 00:01:25.062
and drink the whole thing?

00:01:25.062 --> 00:01:26.197
- I think so.

00:01:26.197 --> 00:01:28.695
- I'm actually starting
to salivate a little bit.

00:01:28.695 --> 00:01:32.085
This is kind of like a
Pavlovian experiment.

00:01:32.085 --> 00:01:33.616
Oh it smells so (beep) good, oh God.

00:01:33.616 --> 00:01:34.857
(Simon laughs)

00:01:34.857 --> 00:01:35.934
- [Garrett] It does look healthy

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:37.181
with those cucumber sticks in there.

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:38.014
- It does.

00:01:39.139 --> 00:01:41.950
Oh gosh, this tastes like summer.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.608
- [Simon] This maybe is
daytime drinking for you.

00:01:43.608 --> 00:01:44.742
- [Garrett] Yeah no this
feel definitely like--

00:01:44.742 --> 00:01:45.575
(Shila and Simon laugh)

00:01:45.575 --> 00:01:46.820
the sun is beating down.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:48.265
It's so refreshing.

00:01:48.265 --> 00:01:49.368
- Oh my God!

00:01:49.368 --> 00:01:50.358
- Oh my God.

00:01:50.358 --> 00:01:51.617
- Oh wow.

00:01:51.617 --> 00:01:52.534
- Ooh what?

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:55.984
- Man, nothing but
quality for these drinks.

00:01:55.984 --> 00:01:57.350
- That's fancy.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.983
- So it has like a citrus-y start.

00:01:58.983 --> 00:02:00.609
But then it has this like creamy finish.

00:02:00.609 --> 00:02:02.274
But you can still taste the whiskey.

00:02:02.274 --> 00:02:04.674
Which is, I don't know how you did it.

00:02:04.674 --> 00:02:05.688
- It's not like overpoweringly sweet.

00:02:05.688 --> 00:02:07.955
Because the watermelon's
still put a lot of, like,

00:02:07.955 --> 00:02:08.788
water in it.

00:02:08.788 --> 00:02:10.814
- I think this is my
favorite Negroni of all time.

00:02:10.814 --> 00:02:11.647
Which is crazy--

00:02:11.647 --> 00:02:12.480
- I agree.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.857
- Because I've never had
one with tequila ormesco.

00:02:13.857 --> 00:02:14.690
- I feel like, yeah,

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.084
no it's really cool this drink takes you

00:02:16.084 --> 00:02:17.059
like out of this world.

00:02:17.059 --> 00:02:18.225
Like I feel like I'm not at a bar.

00:02:18.225 --> 00:02:21.327
Like I'm at, you know,
some holiday vacation

00:02:21.327 --> 00:02:22.459
drinkin' this nice drink.

00:02:22.459 --> 00:02:24.809
And it's so smooth and calming.

00:02:24.809 --> 00:02:26.436
And I just, I don't know, I feel at peace.

00:02:26.436 --> 00:02:27.912
Maybe it's the quila talking but.

00:02:27.912 --> 00:02:29.120
- You're a wizard sir.

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:29.994
- You are a wizard.

00:02:29.994 --> 00:02:31.218
- You're a warlock back there.

00:02:31.218 --> 00:02:32.597
- You feel so special and pampered

00:02:32.597 --> 00:02:36.764
when you have like a drink
that's catered just for you.

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:40.323
- You've left me speechless.

00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:41.156
(laughs)

00:02:41.156 --> 00:02:41.989
- [Kuwilileni] I love it.

00:02:41.989 --> 00:02:43.196
- I am already a little tipsy!

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.647
- Yeah it's like wooh!

00:02:44.647 --> 00:02:45.797
- I usually don't drink at noon.

00:02:45.797 --> 00:02:46.815
- No.

00:02:46.815 --> 00:02:49.482
(upbeat music)

